244 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 245 0 R/Alt(A level-against-order diagram, not to time scale. On the left, three shaded columns mark steps with no level on the axis: drives off for the noise floor, then the coherence and condition gates, then the law's first drive predicted. Between them an orange dashed line at minus 20 dB marks the identification, uncorrelated random on every shaker about 20 dB under the target. After the prediction an orange dashed line climbs from minus 21 dB to minus 12 dB, the soft start. Blue solid steps then rise at minus 12, minus 9, minus 6 and minus 3 dB, and a long blue line at 0 dB marks full level, labeled the record.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[103]/Pg 2504 0 R>>
endobj
