893 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 894 0 R/Alt(Two panels sharing a log frequency axis from 20 to 600 Hz. The top panel plots the system's four singular values on a log scale: the first, blue solid, peaks near 100 at six resonances; the second, orange dashed, runs between about 1 and 10; the third, green dash-dot, lower still; the fourth, pink dotted, lowest, around 0.01 to 2. A black dotted line at 0.2 times the largest follows the first singular value's shape 14 dB lower. The bottom panel is a yellow step line of the directions kept, between 1 and 3: one direction at most resonances and from about 50 to 80 Hz, two or three between modes, never four.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[28]/Pg 2514 0 R>>
endobj
