966 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 967 0 R/Alt(Two panels sharing a log frequency axis from 20 to 600 Hz. Top: coherence of the pair from 0 to 1. A blue solid line, the identification, runs near 0.83 at low frequency, dips to about 0.09 near 98 Hz, rises to 1 between about 110 and 160 Hz, dips to about 0.42 near 185 Hz, returns to 1 near 245 Hz and falls to about 0.25 above 450 Hz. Orange triangles, the buzz target, lie on the blue line everywhere except at the dip near 98 Hz, where the coherence is under the black dotted floor at 0.1 and the triangle is at 0. Bottom: phase of the pair in degrees; the blue identification line is near 0 except for a rise to about 145 degrees near 92 Hz, and the orange triangles of the buzz target follow it where the pair is kept.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 2516 0 R>>
endobj
